        "Description": "Greetings, 47. Looking at the gathered intel from ETHER field reports, we have tracked down two revolutionaries linked to Jin Po&apos;s Tungan Valley massacre: Hilda Berg and Viggo Hofsted. You are tasked with eliminating them.\r\rBerg is a revolutionary in Marrakesh planning to overthrow the current military dictatorship in Morocco, while Hofsted is a military line infantry helping Berg achieve their success. With their link to ETHER&apos;s virus and Jin Po, you must eliminate them to weaken Po and ETHER.",
